They are used to damage enemies, destroy rocks, and open up closed regular doors and Secret Rooms. When a bomb pickup spawns, there is a chance for it to be replaced by a Troll Bomb instead.

{{dlc|nr}} Isaac's bombs deal 60 damage to enemies and one full heart of damage to himself.

{{dlc|r}} Isaac's bombs deal 100 damage to enemies and one full heart of damage to himself. Bomb explosions pierce enemy [[armor]].

