== Trivia ==
* Troll Bombs are a reference to Trolling, an internet term for tricking or messing with people psychologically.
** The face on the Troll Bomb depicts the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/trollface Trollface], a face commonly associated with internet trolls and trolling.
* Mega Troll Bombs are spawned by {{E|Super Wrath}}, {{E|Super Pride}}, {{E|War}} (black [[Champion]]), and sometimes {{E|Little Horn}}.
* In the original game, Mega Troll Bombs can't be blocked by obstacles or non-piercing tears, will follow the player at any distance, and are much faster.

